r_01_22","text":"Do you know how freaked we were, knowing there were bullets flying through the Commander's Room?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_23","text":"I got caught up in some business. Sorry for not keeping everyone in the loop.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_24","text":"Oh boy, sounds like you've gotten yourself in hot water again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_25","text":"You poor thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_26","text":"I'll be sticking close to Rosanna, so no need to worry about me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_27","text":"That's easy for you to say!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_28","text":"How can you expect us not to worry?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_29","text":"But... I presume you must have your reasons for doing this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_30","text":"Right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_31","text":"Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_32","text":"Although we may not know the full picture,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_33","text":"what matters most is that you come back safely.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_34","text":"If you're ever in any kind of danger,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_35","text":"be sure to contact us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_36","text":"Yeah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_37","text":"Don't always keep things to yourself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_38","text":"Give us a ring if you're in a jam!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_39","text":"Rain or shine!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_01_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_01_40","text":"Okay. Thank you.","jump":null}],"chat":true}